find: trust.get_or_insert_with(|| project_trust(inputs)).standing(&definition)
replace: pins.get_or_insert_with(|| user_pins(inputs, &mut decided.told)).standing(&definition)
caught-by:
    extensions_found::a_projects_extension_is_listed_by_the_trust_question_in_words_and_loaded_after_a_yes

[break] pinned-turned-off-loaded
rule: The user's extension that `[extensions.<name>] enabled = false` turns off is not loaded, and nothing is said or asked of it.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/ext/found.rs
