[break] pinned-same-name-used
rule: A project's extension that takes the name of one of the user's is not used, and the session says so.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/ext/found.rs
in: decide
find: .find(|(user, _)| *user == found.manifest.name)
replace: .find(|(user, _)| *user == found.manifest.name && false)
caught-by:
    extensions_found::a_projects_extension_of_a_users_name_is_not_used

# ------------------------------------------------------------ what the session is told

[break] pinned-not-told-the-command
rule: The session is told of a user's extension it does not load, with the command that approves it.
