replace: .filter(|pin| pin.kind.as_str() != kind.as_str())
caught-by:
    extensions_found::pruning_the_cache_keeps_every_trusted_projects_entries

[break] pinned-unreadable-store-prunes-all
rule: When a store of pins cannot be read, nothing is pruned: an entry it may pin is kept.
